- Follow `@docs/LP_CONTENT_SPEC.md`, `@docs/ASSET_MAP.md`, and `@docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.
- Design for Japanese small-business owners with low SNS/Web literacy.
- Keep one message per section, short headings, up to three bullets where possible, and generous whitespace.
- Dominant surfaces are white/ivory; violet is the main color; yellow is the accent; red is a tiny brand detail.
- Avoid black neon sections, excessive gradients, dense comparison tables, fake social UI, and long text over photos.
- Use the primary outlined SVG logo. Do not redraw or generate a replacement logo.
- Implement the exact three-plan facts from `@config/site-content.json`; do not fill missing quantities.
- Keep facts, interpretations, and service claims visually and verbally separate.
